### Dataset Strategy and Quality Control

**Structure & Strategy:**
The dataset will be organized into three distinct splits: Training (80%), Validation (10%), and Testing (10%). To prevent data leakage, we will employ a semantic deduplication pipeline using CLIP embeddings to ensure near-duplicate images do not appear across splits. The folder hierarchy will strictly follow `image_generation_dataset/{split}/images/` for assets and `image_generation_dataset/metadata/{split}.jsonl` for annotations.

**Quality Control:**
1. **Prompt Diversity:** Automated checks will verify that no two prompts share >90% n-gram overlap within the same split.
2. **Metadata Completeness:** A schema validator will enforce the presence of all 14 required fields for every entry.
3. **Visual Balance:** A stratified sampling algorithm will ensure equal representation across the 11 defined visual categories before finalizing the splits.

