### Dataset Strategy and Quality Control

**Structure & Strategy:**
I will construct a stratified dataset ensuring balanced representation across the 11 required visual domains. The generation strategy employs a deterministic seeding mechanism to create unique image IDs and filenames that map directly to the `image_generation_dataset/{split}/images/` hierarchy. To prevent data leakage, I will enforce a semantic similarity threshold; no two prompts across different splits will share identical subject-environment-style triplets.

**Quality Control:**
1. **Schema Validation:** Every entry is programmatically checked to ensure all 14 mandatory fields are present and non-null.
2. **Deduplication:** A hash-based check on the `detailed_image_generation_prompt` ensures zero redundancy within and across splits.
3. **Split Integrity:** Entries are assigned to Train (80%), Validation (10%), or Test (10%) sets immediately upon generation to maintain strict isolation.

