### Dataset Strategy and Quality Control

**Structure:** The dataset will be organized into `image_generation_dataset/` with subdirectories for `images/` (organized by split), `metadata/` (containing JSONL files), and explicit split folders (`train/`, `validation/`, `test/`). 

**Generation Strategy:** We will employ a stratified sampling approach to ensure balanced representation across 11 visual categories. Prompts will be generated using a template-based system with randomized modifiers for style, lighting, and composition to maximize diversity. 

**Quality Control:** A two-stage filtering process will be applied: (1) Automated deduplication using perceptual hashing (pHash) with a threshold of 0.95 to prevent near-duplicates across splits; (2) Manual validation of 5% of samples to verify prompt-image alignment and metadata accuracy.

