### Dataset Strategy & Quality Control

**Structure:** The dataset follows a hierarchical folder structure: `image_generation_dataset/` containing `images/`, `metadata/`, and split directories (`train/`, `validation/`, `test/`).
**Generation Strategy:** We will use a stratified sampling approach to ensure balanced representation across 11 visual categories. Prompts are engineered using a template-based system that randomizes subjects, styles, lighting, and camera angles to prevent mode collapse.
**Quality Control:** A dual-filter process is applied: (1) Automated deduplication using perceptual hashing (pHash) to ensure no near-duplicates leak between splits, and (2) Semantic validation to verify all 14 metadata fields are populated and consistent with the image description.

