**Quality-Control Process**: Each entry will undergo automated validation to check for the presence of all 14 required metadata fields. A secondary semantic check will verify that the `detailed image-generation prompt` aligns logically with the `main subject` and `environment`. Finally, a manual spot-check of 5% of the validation set will be performed to ensure artistic coherence and caption accuracy.

